
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101816">
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for the Margin Price iOS application.">
  <title>Privacy Policy | Margin Price</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --background: #101816;
      --surface: #192420;
      --green: #5ee0a0;
      --text: #f3f8f5;
      --muted: #b4c3ba;
      --border: #34453b;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(820px, 90%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 25px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #15201b;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    main {
      padding: 65px 0 85px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0 0 15px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 21px;
      margin-top: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p, li {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    a {
      color: var(--green);
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .date {
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .intro {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin: 35px 0;
    }

    .intro p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="./">
        <img src="appstore.png" alt="Margin Price app icon">
        Margin Price
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p class="date">
        Effective Date: 31 October 2026
      </p>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          Margin Price is an iOS business pricing calculator
          developed by Jim Mason. Your privacy is important.
          This policy explains how information is handled
          when you use the Margin Price application.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Information Stored by the App</h2>

      <p>
        Margin Price allows users to perform pricing,
        margin, markup, VAT, quantity and discount
        calculations.
      </p>

      <p>
        Calculations that you choose to save are stored
        locally on your device. This information is not
        transmitted to the developer or stored on
        developer-operated servers.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Personal Information</h2>

      <p>
        Margin Price does not require you to create an
        account or provide your name, address, telephone
        number or email address to use the application.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Data Collection and Tracking</h2>

      <p>
        Margin Price does not collect personal information
        through the application.
      </p>

      <p>
        The app does not include advertising, third-party
        analytics or user-tracking technologies.
        It does not sell or share user data with
        advertisers or data brokers.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Security</h2>

      <p>
        Saved calculations are held in the application's
        local storage on your device and are protected
        by the security features provided by iOS.
      </p>

      <p>
        Users are encouraged to keep their devices
        updated and protected with a passcode
        or other appropriate security measures.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>

      <p>
        Saved calculations remain on your device
        until you delete them within the app or
        remove the application and its associated
        local data.
      </p>

      <p>
        Device backups may retain copies of application
        data according to your Apple device and
        backup settings.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Internet Connectivity</h2>

      <p>
        Margin Price does not require an internet
        connection for its core calculation features.
        It does not transmit saved calculations
        to a developer-operated online service.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>

      <p>
        Margin Price is intended as a general
        business utility. The application does not
        knowingly collect personal information
        from children.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

      <p>
        This privacy policy may be updated if the
        application or its data-handling practices
        change. Any revised policy will be published
        on this page with an updated effective date.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact and Support</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about this privacy policy
        or require assistance with Margin Price,
        please contact:
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Developer:</strong> Jim Mason
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong>
        <a href="mailto:jimmason000@btinternet.com">
          jimmason000@btinternet.com
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Website:</strong>
        <a href="https://jimmas.github.io/MarginPrice/">
          Margin Price Official Website
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="./">Return to Margin Price homepage</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      &copy; 2026 Jim Mason.
      Margin Price Privacy Policy.
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
